<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO DRAIN PLN 800 MLN FOR 5, 10 DAYS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO DRAIN PLN 800 MLN FOR 5, 10 DAYS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to drain 800 million zlotys, in nominal terms, off the</p>
<p>market for five and 10 days through a reverse NBP-bill</p>
<p>repurchase auction, the bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - April 18, 1997</p>
<p>    Repurchase		    - April 23 and April 28, 1997</p>
<p>    Discount rate (pct)	 - 20.00</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - May 16, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
